      "purpose": "cheap_pre_solver_category_error_check"
    },
    "analysis": "ID-ANALYSIS when identifiability materially affects the campaign, a nontrivial ambiguity is found, or a representative-level recovery claim remains consequential.",
    "certified": "ID-CERTIFIED when an identifiability or obstruction statement itself is promoted as a mathematical claim; MATHCERT remains the certification authority."
